## [2.0.0] - 2026-07-15

### Added
- Modular architecture: Split monolithic script into core modules (`ConfigLoader.ps1`, `OpenTodayLogs.ps1`).
- External configuration: Moved all hardcoded IPs and folder rules to `config.json`.

### Changed
- Refactored `Start-Tool.ps1` as an immutable main entry point that dynamically loads modules.

## v2.1.0

### Added
- Added `OpenMorningPages` module.
- Automatically opens configured morning pages before the work shift starts.
- Supports multiple URLs through the `MorningPages` configuration.
- Skips execution after the configured shift start time.